            <title>[LUDOC-581] Add the kkfilnd mempool reserve parameters to LOM</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LUDOC-581</link>
                <project id="10070" key="LUDOC">Lustre Documentation</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19797" title="kfilnd use mempool for allocation inside kfilnd" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19797"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19797&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; changed kkfilnd to use memory pools for its transaction and message buffers. The new module parameters tn_reserve_min and msg_reserve_min set the reserve size of these pools. The Lustre Operations Manual must document the parameters, their defaults and the automatic size.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
